<p>The <a href="https://www.amacad.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">American Academy of Arts &amp; Sciences</a> has announced its latest class of members, and several philosophers are a part of it.<span id="more-57223"></span></p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="wp-image-45862 aligncenter wp-dark-mode-bg-image" src="https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout.png" sizes="(max-width: 701px) 100vw, 701px" srcset="https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout.png 4639w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout-300x200.png 300w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout-1024x683.png 1024w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout-768x513.png 768w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout-1536x1025.png 1536w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout-2048x1367.png 2048w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/american-academy-seal-cutout-400x267.png 400w" alt="" width="628" height="419" /></p>
