<p>The full list of new members is <a href="https://www.amacad.org/new-members-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</p>
<p>The American Academy of Arts &amp; Sciences is a learned society founded in 1780 by John Adams, John Hancock, and other Founding Fathers of the United States. You can learn more about it <a href="https://www.amacad.org/about-academy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</p>
<p>Induction ceremonies for new members will take place in Cambridge, Massachusetts, in October 2026.</p><p>The post <a href="https://dailynous.com/2026/04/23/philosophers-elected-to-the-american-academy-of-arts-sciences/">Philosophers Elected to the American Academy of Arts & Sciences</a> first appeared on <a href="https://dailynous.com">Daily Nous</a>.</p>